          %h2#references References
          %h3#plain_notion_2 Plain notion
          %p
            Real vector bundles in the plain sense are the default notion of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+bundles"} vector bundles
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "vector+bundle#Literature"} there
          %h3#in_krtheory_2 In KR-theory
          %p
            The notion of “Real vector bundle” over a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Real+space"} Real space
            in the sense of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KR-theory"} KR-theory
            was introduced in:
          %ul
            %li#Atiyah66
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Atiyah"}> Michael Atiyah
                , p. 368 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em K-theory and reality
                %strong 17
                1 (1966) 367-386 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/qmath/17.1.367"}> doi:10.1093/qmath/17.1.367
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/AtiyahKReal.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Allan+L.+Edelson"}> Allan L. Edelson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Real Vector Bundles and Spaces with Free Involutions
                %strong 157
                (1971) 179-188 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/1995841"}> doi:10.2307/1995841
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/1995841"} jstor:1995841
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Allan+L.+Edelson"}> Allan L. Edelson
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Real Line Bundles on Spheres
                %strong 27
                3 (1971) 579-583 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.2307/2036501"}> doi:10.2307/2036501
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/2036501"} jstor:2036501
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (on Real
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/line+bundles"} line bundles
                  over
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spheres"} spheres
                  = succeed ")" do
